SUMMARY:AYPROS Night at UNC Asheville Men's Basketball
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Young Professionals (AYPROS)\n**An entire section re
 served for AYPROS. A special shoutout during the game. A group photo ON TH
 E COURT afterward. And tickets are just $5.**\nWe're teaming up with UNC A
 sheville Athletics for a special AYPROS Night at Kimmel Arena on **Wednesd
 ay\, November 18**\, and this is one you won't want to miss.\nThe Bulldogs
  are rolling out the welcome mat for Asheville's young professionals! We'v
 e got our own reserved seating section so we can cheer on the Bulldogs tog
 ether\, and UNC Asheville is planning a special **AYPROS announcement over
  the arena's PA system during the game.** Even better? After the final buz
 zer\, we'll have the opportunity to head down onto the basketball court fo
 r an official AYPROS group photo!\nHow often do you get to walk onto the c
 ourt at Kimmel Arena? We're hoping to fill Section 6 with as many AYPROS m
 embers as possible\, so grab your friends\, coworkers\, significant others
 \, or anyone who enjoys a great night of college basketball. Whether you'r
 e a die-hard Bulldogs fan or haven't been to a game in years\, this is a p
 retty great excuse to get out\, meet some new people\, and show some love 
 for our hometown team.\n\nThe Bulldogs will be taking on the **Tennessee T
 ech Golden Eagles**\, and there's even more to look forward to than just t
 he game! UNC Asheville will be giving out special promotional cups that ev
 ening\, and we're working with the Athletics team on a few additional surp
 rises just for our AYPROS attendees. Between the game\, our reserved secti
 on\, the in-game recognition\, and the chance to get everyone together on 
 the court afterward\, this is shaping up to be a pretty special night. We'
 ll share more details as we get closer\, but for now\, get your tickets\, 
 find something blue to wear\, and help us give the Bulldogs a proper home-
 court advantage!\n**Tickets are only $5 (normally $25) with our exclusive 
 AYPROS discount code.** That's a night of Division I college basketball\, 
 reserved seating with our crew\, a special in-game recognition\, and a cha
 nce to be part of a photo on the court afterward for less than the price o
 f most coffees. Plus\, plus\, plus...\n\n### Game Day Details\n\n* **Date:
 ** Wednesday\, November 18\, 2026\n* **Time:** 6:30 PM\n* **Location:** Ki
 mmel Arena at UNC Asheville\n* **AYPROS Seating:** Section 6\n* **Tickets:
 ** Just $5 with promo code **AYPROS**\n* **What to Wear:** Your best BULLD
 OGS BLUE! We want to see a sea of blue in our section and in our group pho
 to.\n\n### How to Get Your $5 Tickets\n\n1. Click **[Purchase Your AYPROS 
 Tickets Here](https://university-of-north-carolina-asheville-ilh9.vivenush
 op.com/event/6a79dfcabe06b62435059128/6ab535875a3b4d739107f1a1)**.\n2. Sel
 ect "Buy Tickets" and enter promo code **AYPROS** when prompted.\n3. Choos
 e your seats in Section 6 and complete your purchase.\n\nWe've reserved Se
 ction 6 specifically for AYPROS\, and we'd love nothing more than to fill 
 it! Tickets are available directly through UNC Asheville Athletics\, so be
  sure to purchase yours and encourage your friends to do the same.\n**One 
 last thing: DON'T FORGET TO WEAR BLUE!** If we're going to get recognized 
 in front of the arena and take a group photo on the court\, we might as we
 ll look like we belong there.\nA huge thank you to **Kassi Butcher and the
  UNC Asheville Athletics team** for helping put this special evening toget
 her for AYPROS.\n**Let's pack Section 6\, cheer on the Bulldogs\, and make
  this an AYPROS Night worth remembering!**\n\n**GO UNC ASHEVILLE BULLDOGS!
 **
